WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.633
When your front desk is busy, callers still need

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:03.233
an answer.

00:00:03.633 --> 00:00:06.500
Flow Audit is an AI phone agent configured around

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.933
your practice, supporting your team with agreed call workflows.

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:13.133
This recorded demonstration uses Google Calendar.

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:16.067
Listen to the appointment choices, then see the selected

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:16.467
booking.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:19.900
The recording includes privacy beeps and edited labels.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.867
The first available appointment this afternoon

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:26.833
is at 2.30 or three in the afternoon or 3.30.

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:28.300
Which one works for you?

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.533
Can we do three o'clock?

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.100
Your new patient check-up appointment

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.967
is booked for Wednesday, the 7th of October

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:36.767
at 3pm.

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:38.500
The team has all your details

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.133
and looks forward to seeing you then.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.733
That's one booking workflow.

00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:44.133
Integration depends on your setup.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.300
Agreed scope and initial payment start configuration; we then

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.267
test with your team.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:51.200
Activation follows practice approval.

00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:54.667
Book a fifteen-minute Flow Audit walkthrough with the purchasing

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.300
decision-maker.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.200
We'll discuss requirements, implementation, investment and, if it

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.367
fits, getting started.
